      "end": 598.54
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "kind": "list",
      "selector": "#post-body > ul:nth-of-type(5) > li:nth-of-type(1)",
      "text": "封面照片：你最好的食物或房间照片。这是出现在搜索结果中的照片。",
      "start": 598.89,
      "end": 605.55
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "kind": "list",
      "selector": "#post-body > ul:nth-of-type(5) > li:nth-of-type(2)",
      "text": "标志：你的餐厅标志，正方形格式，干净的背景。",
